    {
      "id": "01",
      "path": "CUDA_coding/knowledge/wiki/decisions/ADR-005-TASK-007不实施persistent-host-staging.md",
      "snapshot": "CUDA_coding/knowledge/outputs/validation/KB-GOV-012-20260909-g3-candidate-archive/raw/pages/01.txt",
      "sourceSha256": "36c9a9d581a978307fbddb97057a9dc4d0095e280aeb90f957bb52abe89dd2d6",
      "bytes": 4294,
      "sha256": "d7d7abd899f50c0c60ad45477bf58de1fa86cd8f19b2cdc223171c0f9c7d43ba",
      "edits": [
        {
          "before": "source_ids: [SRC-003P]",
          "after": "source_ids: [SRC-003P, SRC-026, SRC-032]"
        },
        {
          "before": "\n## ",
          "after": "\n## 2026-09-09 G3候选注释\n\n下文2026-08-25的pageable否定结果、2026-08-28的pinned重开及设计批准均作为历史保留。后续按2026-08-31用户批准的停止规则，persistent pinned候选已作[撤回处置](../../outputs/validation/TASK-007-20260830-task5-target-gates/TASK-007-20260831-withdrawal-disposition.md)，L6保留`NOT-RUN/environment limitation`；撤回不等于证明无收益或求解器正确性失败，也不把旧设计批准升级为采用。\n\n来源角色：SRC-003P是实现背景；SRC-032是下文五次正式profile的实测输入；SRC-026支持TASK-025正式per-call pinned负结果。批准/撤回由各自文档说明，不冒充实验来源。\n\n## ",
          "firstOnly": true
        }
      ],
      "attribution": "Inherited entire draft page; KB-GOV-012 only the listed annotations and source_ids additions"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "path": "CUDA_coding/knowledge/wiki/decisions/ADR-006-TASK-020暂不实施overlap.md",
      "snapshot": "CUDA_coding/knowledge/outputs/validation/KB-GOV-012-20260909-g3-candidate-archive/raw/pages/02.txt",
      "sourceSha256": "10f38d989f7b72747a2955fd96c8fcbba1ffa4fe5e4c8c1c7bbaf850f72ca716",
      "bytes": 2294,
      "sha256": "6f8ff24ec90aa17f3aefcef2e4cc6351c96c693d08e26b858ccf3935e0896267",
      "edits": [
        {
          "before": "source_ids: [SRC-003P, SRC-020, SRC-021]",
          "after": "source_ids: [SRC-003P, SRC-020, SRC-021, SRC-032, SRC-033]"
        },
        {
          "before": "\n## ",
          "after": "\n## 2026-09-09 G3候选注释\n\n下文MPI-only占比来自SRC-032的五个正式作业；SRC-033登记由这些输入得到的TASK-020模型、CSV及原清单。SRC-003P/020/021仅作实现和论文背景。`10.8458%`是50%效率假设下的预测，3/5是模型稳定性Gate，均不是实测overlap加速；原决策、阈值和重开条件保留。\n\n## ",
          "firstOnly": true
        }
      ],
      "attribution": "Inherited entire draft page; KB-GOV-012 only the listed annotations and source_ids additions"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "path": "CUDA_coding/knowledge/wiki/experiments/EXP-003-TASK-023-direct-communication-diagnostics.md",
      "snapshot": "CUDA_coding/knowledge/outputs/validation/KB-GOV-012-20260909-g3-candidate-archive/raw/pages/03.txt",
      "sourceSha256": "ecda9f89e0fe1aae1153721177182e3be00be89a7b9e94237d7678c731a03960",
      "bytes": 3821,
      "sha256": "67ab9a7d87ef6367b8e105972982d80e6cd86fbcad81759c724016745e53039c",
      "edits": [
        {
          "before": "\n## ",
          "after": "\n## 2026-09-09 G3候选注释\n\n下方Plain表采用stable8敏感性口径；主协议all10与其分别报告。[固定JSON](../../outputs/validation/TASK-023-20260827-formal-validation-v2/local/job1457454-analysis-summary.json)的`statistics.plain_22_vs_28_paired_percent.p2_all10.median`为`-9.847843444%`，`p2_stable8.median`为`-14.504494936%`。五次配对按启动序号对应，22/28槽启动块未按时间交错（`limits[4]`）；本注释不把两种统计口径混用或改称通信字节收益。\n\n## ",
          "firstOnly": true
        }
      ],
      "attribution": "Inherited entire draft page; KB-GOV-012 only the listed annotations and source_ids additions"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "path": "CUDA_coding/knowledge/wiki/experiments/EXP-004-TASK-025-per-call-pinned-staging.md",
      "snapshot": "CUDA_coding/knowledge/outputs/validation/KB-GOV-012-20260909-g3-candidate-archive/raw/pages/04.txt",
      "sourceSha256": "4d4936439d16f03daefa9e2ef56bad19d6d46c4cc136236c56cbe24fce9ff6a0",
      "bytes": 3958,
      "sha256": "819f7b7406f17542b67f7b8e71aa4bb86158c31255885a221632e8e5c81add89",
      "edits": [
        {
          "before": "\n## ",
          "after": "\n## 2026-09-09 G3候选注释\n\n下表D2H/H2D“降低范围”由forward和backward两个方向降幅的最小值、最大值组成，非置信区间。[阶段回读](../../outputs/validation/TASK-025-20260828-local-implementation/30-job1459808-profiled-stage-readback.md)先按运行/方向/迭代取双rank最大值，再对五次正式运行各8轮、共40个样本求均值。smoke无显式回落另由[job1459639回执](../../outputs/validation/TASK-025-20260828-local-implementation/13-job1459639-local-readback.md)支持；SRC-026与[最终合同复核](../../outputs/validation/TASK-025-20260828-local-implementation/34-TASK-025-final-contract-review.md)对应正式per-call负结果，不把正式包来源自动扩为smoke包或persistent收益证明。\n\n## ",
          "firstOnly": true
        }
      ],
      "attribution": "Inherited entire draft page; KB-GOV-012 only the listed annotations and source_ids additions"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "path": "CUDA_coding/knowledge/wiki/reference/adjacent-tdma-optimization-transfer-to-penta.md",
      "snapshot": "CUDA_coding/knowledge/outputs/validation/KB-GOV-012-20260909-g3-candidate-archive/raw/pages/05.txt",
      "sourceSha256": "c929bc63b84e5f2b6deff99890694d0aa87dc11fabdacc29baff4cd070721abf",
      "bytes": 7368,
      "sha256": "5163fe8c2fe08203ba037db98983e1547f80ff177a4a349ddac94beafd07a478",
      "edits": [
        {
          "before": "source_ids: [SRC-019, SRC-020, SRC-021]",
          "after": "source_ids: [SRC-019, SRC-020, SRC-021, SRC-026, SRC-032, SRC-033]"
        },
        {
          "before": "\n## ",
          "after": "\n## 2026-09-09 G3候选注释\n\n本页项目状态栏和TASK-007/020段按原`updated: 2026-08-25`时点阅读；既有正文及`review_by: 2026-09-07`保留，不自动续期。TASK-007后续pinned重开和2026-08-31撤回见[[../decisions/ADR-005-TASK-007不实施persistent-host-staging]]；TASK-020模型边界见[[../decisions/ADR-006-TASK-020暂不实施overlap]]。实时排程读取开发树[[../../meta/task-queue]]，本归档随带queue仅是固定G2历史快照。\n\nSRC-019/020/021提供三对角方法背景；SRC-032/033分别支持本项目旧profile与派生模型，SRC-026支持per-call pinned负结果。开头的优化顺序是项目方法建议，不是三篇论文共同证明的定理；不升级为五对角采用、性能或启动授权。\n\n## ",
          "firstOnly": true
        }
      ],
      "attribution": "Inherited entire draft page; KB-GOV-012 only the listed annotations and source_ids additions"
    },
